Description: apt pin canary for the usg-plat repository (never installable)
 Empty package. The usg-plat repository publishes it so that
 `usg-plat-verify selftest --apt` can show that the -1 pin for names other
 than platd and usg-plat-verify matches the repository origin: apt must
 report `Candidate: (none)` for it. If apt ever offers to install it, the
 pin does not match and the host fails open; selftest then fails.

